SUMMARY:Richard Louv on Noticing: Intimate Encounters with the Natural Wor
 ld
DTSTART:20261106T013000Z
DTEND:20261106T033000Z
DTSTAMP:20261101T124323Z
UID:3bd27163-8443-5678-832b-d07be2569b4a
DESCRIPTION:What does it mean to truly notice the world around you? In an 
 age of distraction\, climate anxiety\, and accelerating disconnection from
  the natural world\, author Richard Louv invites us to slow down\, open ou
 r senses\, and rediscover the living world just outside our doors\, and to
  find in that connection a source of hope and a reason to act.\n\nMore inf
 o & tickets: https://www.commonwealthclub.org/events/2026-11-05/richard-lo
 uv-noticing-intimate-encounters-natural-world
