 gmented than ever\, streaming giants keep changing their business models\,
  and funding battles are ongoing. \nIn this ever-changing environment\, h
 ow will public media evolve to deliver on its mission to educate\, inspire
 \, and unite?\n\nMore info & tickets: https://www.commonwealthclub.org/eve
 nts/2026-11-09/future-public-media-paula-kerger-and-michael-isip
