BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Humanist Review of AI: Abundance & Scarcity
DTSTART:20261119T040000Z
DTEND:20261119T060000Z
DTSTAMP:20261101T124323Z
UID:44ab1a0c-7a9b-5268-b67f-a185c336e36f
DESCRIPTION:What becomes scarce when intelligence is abundant? Artificial 
 intelligence promises a new era of abundance—but how will it deliver on 
 that promise? And what impact will abundance have on how our society works
 ?\nThis event marks the publication of the second issue of The Humanist Re
 view of AI\, a new journal of ideas funded by Microsoft AI that explores t
 hese questions. \nFor more\, visit the Humanist Review of AI's website. 
 \nAbout the Speakers\n\nMore info & tickets: https://www.commonwealthclub.
 org/events/2026-11-18/humanist-review-ai-abundance-scarcity
LOCATION:Commonwealth Club World Affairs of California\, Taube Family Audi
 torium\, San Francisco\, CA
URL:https://www.commonwealthclub.org/events/2026-11-18/humanist-review-ai-
 abundance-scarcity
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Machine-Mediated Economy: When AI Becomes the Interface to Eve
 rything
DTSTART:20261120T013000Z
DTEND:20261120T033000Z
DTSTAMP:20261101T124323Z
UID:a538b0ee-cdf9-55e9-abe3-27ca6624b10e
DESCRIPTION:We’re entering an economy where AI increasingly sits between
  people and the companies\, products and services they choose. Discovery\,
  evaluation\, comparison and eventually transactions are moving inside AI.
  \nWhat happens when your customer’s AI talks to your company’s AI be
 fore the customer ever talks to you? We’ll explore what this shift means
  for business and markets\, along with what Toby Corey's team is learning 
 firsthand building BrandCapsule\, an AI discovery intelligence company.\nA
 bout the Speakers\n\nMore info & tickets: https://www.commonwealthclub.org
 /events/2026-11-19/machine-mediated-economy-when-ai-becomes-interface-ever
 ything
LOCATION:Commonwealth Club World Affairs of California\, Toni Rembe Rock A
 uditorium\, San Francisco\, CA
URL:https://www.commonwealthclub.org/events/2026-11-19/machine-mediated-ec
 onomy-when-ai-becomes-interface-everything
END:VEVENT
