UID:49bd130d-9216-514b-ba51-1746278eb0b1
DESCRIPTION:A novelist and an economist walk into a bar. Outside\, the wor
 ld is in polycrisis.\nOne of them spent 20 years in the belly of the beast
 \, becoming the second youngest managing director in JPMorgan's history\, 
 followed by a two-decade search after a close encounter with 9/11. The oth
 er has spent four decades writing novels set on Mars\, in a flooded New Yo
 rk\, and inside a ministry created to speak for generations not yet born. 
 You might expect the banker to bring the hard facts and the novelist the i
 magination. On this evening\, it may run the other way.\n\nMore info & tic
 kets: https://www.commonwealthclub.org/events/2026-12-08/novelist-economis
 t-kim-stanley-robinson-and-john-fullerton-story-we-need-next
