UID:4b52db21-1d16-5b1a-8c1c-7a3c61afc07a
DESCRIPTION:Have questions about weather and climate? Daniel Swain has ans
 wers. Swain’s research on “hydroclimate whiplash”—the extreme swi
 ngs between floods and fires—is fundamental. But the general public know
 s him better as the host of the popular blog and YouTube channel “Weathe
 r West\,” which has tens of thousands of subscribers. In his quest to ma
 ke extreme weather\, climate change\, and associated natural hazards under
 standable and accurate in public discourse\, Swain holds weekly “office 
 hours” on YouTube and gives over 200 interviews a year across hundreds o
 f media outlets.\n\nMore info & tickets: https://www.commonwealthclub.org/
 events/2026-12-08/daniel-swain-2026-stephen-schneider-award-outstanding-cl
