DTSTAMP:20261101T124323Z
UID:35cfbee1-ca3e-5911-a966-4d90eb7f7093
DESCRIPTION:Masked troops of ICE and CBP are scooping up immigrants\, occa
 sionally shooting or beating one or two. Is this good policy? \nImmigrati
 on is a policy issue with both social and economic implications. Economics
  has something to say about both. This presentation will shed light on sev
 eral aspects of immigration that tend to overwhelm the narrative. These ar
 e: crime\, government support programs\, and jobs. It will also raise othe
 r issues that ought to be contemplated when developing appropriate immigra
 tion policy.\nAbout the Speaker\n\nMore info & tickets: https://www.common
 wealthclub.org/events/2026-12-17/jon-haveman-economics-immigration
